{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:00ab628d54352e1a3ca9252381fa7e8c5c5aa2dd7b125d4a79400a2a5976b177", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThus we may use the following natural definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:35322e4680cc43900423677afa805c977a7e233dfb5b517fe59270b0a952b65f", "unit_id": "tag:0CI5:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n|\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Z}|\n$$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-universal-homeomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:034bdcc7c461c8bae021bc53ec9f672696fd1948b47a7c22a57d80e661d85fe4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:48bd885177bdae2697b0a3821bfdfc57c79ead7ab24d1f593f4fc6e7ade7b3bf", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>universal homeomorphism<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every morphism\nof algebraic stacks <MATH_0003>\nthe map of topological spaces\n<MATH_0004>\nis a homeomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:89ec8b98097a50b20f15bcaaea0b80eb4776c3400aec053aaecfc5c724ed1dd2", "unit_id": "tag:0CI7:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universal-homeomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:71a37f7c25b885cddea883be26858df5854d24544a0bd4c5be11ce55bfffd869", "source_text": "The base change of a universal homeomorphism of algebraic stacks\nby any morphism of algebraic stacks is a universal homeomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9c441178f5a6335d1bdaf71826748e6532f9766efde4de1461d74868dde5b4e3", "unit_id": "tag:0CI8:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:00cf41773a6631faeaf7833d0fdba0bae5d517953f51b440c8f01c25a24b26cf", "source_text": "This is immediate from the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed527da30f69c9bcc90112222bdf3d207c927d6febb801818b673598175ce475", "unit_id": "tag:0CI8:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-universal-homeomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1599204749c4c719279c7dcce0bc32f9baf8933d8f278c44e81613c784c245a7", "source_text": "The composition of a pair of universal homeomorphisms of\nalgebraic stacks is a universal homeomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5cfb91bf38b33684ccb2743a9ab67cc80089a462b7638ff3c815f0ce1c0a43e8", "unit_id": "tag:0CI9:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:00cf41773a6631faeaf7833d0fdba0bae5d517953f51b440c8f01c25a24b26cf", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0CI9:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$W$", "MATH_0004": "$W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to W$", "MATH_0005": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-check-universal-homeomorphism-covering}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:87955b6b44be14f27ae02579c55634c9110a1b1232924689b9913f16226d9a28", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8477785fb2458313b4be3d55dd1b680d5d849ad52b9e4216ed7e2eb849580825", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be surjective, flat, and locally of finite\npresentation where <MATH_0003> is an algebraic space. If the base change\n<MATH_0004> is a universal homeomorphism,\nthen <MATH_0005> is a universal homeomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7f7b4fcc608bb0e8c554bd41a6e94a9b17647e9dc45acac439a3131b6e489f52", "unit_id": "tag:0DTQ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CI5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$g : W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to W$", "MATH_0002": "$g$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0006": "$U$", "MATH_0007": "$U \\to W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nW \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^g &\nU \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\ar[d] \\ar[l] \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\ar[d] \\\\\nW &\nU \\ar[l] \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{Z}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$g$", "MATH_0010": "$U \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0011": "$U \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$|\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Z}|$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-check-universally-injective-covering}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fc10657496cc0551064b40e8a7b53644b072dc3efc429028fcef502f479b4123", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a8d462b2ef9ee3adf383d0dfd955d7ceae4ee9dcffe6633ccb9eeab14b97cb35", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is a universal\nhomeomorphism. Then <MATH_0002> is universally injective, hence <MATH_0003> is\nuniversally injective by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nOn the other hand, let <MATH_0004>\nbe a morphism with <MATH_0005> an algebraic stack.\nChoose a scheme <MATH_0006> and a surjective\nsmooth morphism <MATH_0007>.\nConsider the diagram\n<MATH_0008>\nThe middle vertical arrow induces a homeomorphism\non topological space by assumption on <MATH_0009>.\nThe morphism <MATH_0010> and\n<MATH_0011>\nare surjective, flat, and locally of finite presentation\nhence induce open maps on topological spaces.\nWe conclude that\n<MATH_0012>\nis open. Surjectivity is easy to prove; we omit the proof.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cf951bb87b7e0498aed9daad1f10a20dd2d5f4c12bd97a731b63df1ce33602ff", "unit_id": "tag:0DTQ:proof"}
